From: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 9 Jul 2026 10:31:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] perf: add load_kvc and store_kvc latency stats

Log Yuanrong/Mooncake/Memcache get (load_kvc) and put (store_kvc)
latency with transfer bytes, and add an offline log parser that
summarizes avg, percentiles, and MB/s throughput grouped by
backend/op.

Signed-off-by: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
